{"id":"ganado","lemma":"ganado","pos":"noun","rank":905,"glosses":["livestock, cattle","herd (group of animals)","swarm (group of bees)"],"ipa":"/ɡaˈnado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ganados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ganado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién ha ganado hoy?","en":"Who won today?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410437","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"today, tonight"}]},{"text":"Tenemos diez cabezas de ganado.","en":"We have ten head of cattle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64627","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"A"},{"g":"head","l":"cabeza"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Has ganado peso, ¿verdad?","en":"You've put on weight, haven't you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352749","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"weight"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"El ganado se murió de hambre.","en":"The cattle starved to death.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642062","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"He ganado el primer premio.","en":"I've won first prize!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44283","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"prize, award"}]}]}